# Calendar (rediseno-calendario-color): the month opens clean (neutral dots, deadline flag, today = number in a
# filled circle, selected = light outline) and the focus wash is an optional layer behind the «Focus» chip. The
# Week view is a week strip + a continuous agenda of the seven days.
# Needs the seed (python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device): focus on past days, today's tasks, and a
# pending task + project deadline 3 days from today (the "other day with items" this walk selects; in the last
# three days of a month that day is in the next month and the TAP below finds nothing).
# Each month cell's content description says its marks ("20, Selected, Task, Deadline"), so a day is picked by
# what it holds, not by its position. "Focus" is only in a description while the layer is on.
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/pcu-calendar.steps --save pcu-calendar
GRANT android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
START .configuration.SplashActivity
WAIT 5000
TAP id=navigation_calendar_month
WAIT 2000
ASSERT id=monthCalendarView
ASSERT id=monthTodayButton
ASSERT id=calendarFocusToggle
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-clean
TAP text=deadline|entrega
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=dayDetailTitle
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-other-day
SWIPE 540 1400 540 500 300
WAIT 800
ASSERT id=calendarAgendaCard
ASSERT id=dayDetailRecycler
SHOT pcu-calendar-day-list
SWIPE 540 600 540 1500 300
WAIT 800
# Focus layer on: sage wash on the days with focus, the scale under the grid, minutes in the day summary.
TAP id=calendarFocusToggle
WAIT 1000
ASSERT id=calendarLegend
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-focus-layer
TAP id=monthTodayButton
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=dayDetailTitle
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-today-focus
# Week view: strip + agenda. The focus layer stays on (shared with the month).
TAP id=calendarModeWeek
WAIT 2000
ASSERT id=weekStripView
ASSERT id=weekAgendaRecycler
ASSERT id=calendarAddEventButton2
SHOT pcu-calendar-week
TAP id=weekNextButton
WAIT 1200
SHOT pcu-calendar-week-next
TAP id=weekTodayButton
WAIT 1200
TAP id=calendarFocusToggle
WAIT 800
SHOT pcu-calendar-week-clean
TAP id=calendarModeMonth
WAIT 1500
ASSERT id=monthCalendarView
